{
  "name": "codeblocks-vscode",
  "displayName": "Code::Blocks for VS Code",
  "description": "原生移植 Code::Blocks 核心功能到 VS Code：项目模型、构建引擎、编译器管理与调试引擎",
  "version": "0.8.80-dev",
  "icon": "resources/icon.png",
  "publisher": "robinmaomao",
  "author": {
    "name": "Robinmaomao"
  },
  "license": "SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE.md",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/robinmaomao/vscode-codeblocks-emu.git"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.85.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Programming Languages",
    "Debuggers",
    "Formatters",
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "codeblocks",
    "c++",
    "c",
    "build",
    "compiler",
    "gcc",
    "gdb"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onLanguage:c",
    "onLanguage:cpp",
    "workspaceContains:**/*.cbp",
    "workspaceContains:**/*.workspace"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.newProject",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: New Project",
        "icon": "$(new-file)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.openProject",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Open Project (.cbp)",
        "icon": "$(folder-opened)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.build",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Build",
        "icon": "$(package)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.rebuild",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Rebuild",
        "icon": "$(sync)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.buildWorkspace",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Build Workspace",
        "icon": "$(package)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.build.stop",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Stop Build",
        "icon": "$(debug-stop)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.buildAndRun",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Build and Run"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.compileFileWithoutProject",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Compile File (Without Project)",
        "icon": "$(run-above)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.buildLog.toggleErrorsOnly",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Toggle Errors Only (Build Log)",
        "icon": "$(filter)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.buildLog.copyMessage",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Copy Diagnostic Message"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.buildLog.copyDiagnostic",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Copy Full Diagnostic"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.openRecentProject",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Open Recent Project"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.resetViewLayout",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Reset View Layout"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.analysis.refresh",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Refresh Analysis",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.analysis.locate",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Locate in .cbp"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.analysis.copyXml",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Copy .cbp Snippet"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.clean",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Clean",
        "icon": "$(trash)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.cleanWorkspace",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Clean Workspace",
        "icon": "$(trash)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.rebuildWorkspace",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Rebuild Workspace",
        "icon": "$(sync)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.run",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Run",
        "icon": "$(play)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.selectTarget",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Select Build Target"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.selectProjectTarget",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Select Build Target for Project"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.detectCompilers",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Detect Compilers"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.compilerOptions",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Compiler Options",
        "icon": "$(settings-gear)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.projectProperties",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Project Properties",
        "icon": "$(gear)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.generateCompileCommands",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Generate compile_commands.json (IntelliSense)",
        "icon": "$(code)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.debug",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Debug",
        "icon": "$(debug-alt)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.codeStats",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Code Statistics",
        "icon": "$(graph)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.todoList",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: TODO List"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.format",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Format with AStyle"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.insertHeaderGuard",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Insert Header Guard"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.tidyComments",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Tidy Comments"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.swapHeaderSource",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Swap Header / Source"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.runTool",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Run Tool"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.configureTools",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Configure Tools…"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.showCompilerCommands",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Show Compiler Commands"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.exportMakefile",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Export Makefile"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.workspace.editDependencies",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Edit Workspace Dependencies"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.importProject",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Import Project (Dev-C++ / VC6 / VS2010+)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.openDefaultConfig",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Open default.conf"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.moveProjectUp",
        "title": "Move Up",
        "icon": "$(arrow-up)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.moveProjectDown",
        "title": "Move Down",
        "icon": "$(arrow-down)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.removeProject",
        "title": "Remove Project",
        "icon": "$(close)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.buildProject",
        "title": "Build",
        "icon": "$(package)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.rebuildProject",
        "title": "Rebuild",
        "icon": "$(sync)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.cleanProject",
        "title": "Clean",
        "icon": "$(trash)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.addFile",
        "title": "Add Files...",
        "icon": "$(add)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.removeFile",
        "title": "Remove File from Project",
        "icon": "$(close)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.openContainingFolder",
        "title": "Open Containing Folder",
        "icon": "$(folder-opened)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.toggleCompile",
        "title": "Compile File"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.toggleLink",
        "title": "Link File"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.compileFile",
        "title": "Build File"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.cleanFile",
        "title": "Clean File"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.editFileBuildCommand",
        "title": "Edit Custom Build Command..."
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.nextError",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Next Error"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.prevError",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Previous Error"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.compileCurrentFile",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Compile Current File",
        "icon": "$(run-above)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.clearErrors",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Clear All Errors"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.activatePriorProject",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Activate Prior Project"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.activateNextProject",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Activate Next Project"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.toggleCategorize",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Categorize Project Tree by File Types"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.clearRecentProjects",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Clear Recent Projects"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.projectNotes",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Project Notes"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.setProgramArguments",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Set Programs' Arguments"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.showGlobalVariables",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Show Global Variables"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.clearBacktickCache",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Clear Backtick Cache"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.keybindings.check",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Check Keybinding Conflicts",
        "icon": "$(keyboard)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.keybindings.apply",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Apply Keybindings"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.keybindings.configure",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Configure Keybindings…",
        "icon": "$(keyboard)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.keybindings.reset",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Reset Keybindings"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.keybindings.panel",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Keybinding Settings",
        "icon": "$(keyboard)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.keybindings.export",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Export Keybinding Scheme"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.keybindings.import",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Import Keybinding Scheme"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.debug.refreshRegisters",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Refresh Registers",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.debug.sendGdbCommand",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Send GDB Command…",
        "icon": "$(terminal)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.debug.setNextStatement",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Set Next Statement",
        "icon": "$(debug-step-over)"
      },
      {
        "command": "codeblocks.debug.attachToProcess",
        "title": "Code::Blocks: Attach to Process…",
        "icon": "$(debug-alt)"
      }
    ],
    "languages": [
      { "id": "ld", "aliases": ["GNU ld", "ld"], "extensions": [".ld", ".lcf"], "configuration": "./language-configurations/ld.json" },
      { "id": "asm", "extensions": [".S", ".s"], "aliases": ["GNU Assembly (RISC-V)"] },
      { "id": "xm", "aliases": ["xmaker xm", "xm"], "extensions": [".xm"], "configuration": "./language-configurations/xm.json" }
    ],
    "grammars": [
      { "language": "ld", "scopeName": "source.ld", "path": "./syntaxes/ld.tmLanguage.json" },
      { "language": "asm", "scopeName": "source.asm", "path": "./syntaxes/asm.tmLanguage.json" },
      { "language": "xm", "scopeName": "source.xm", "path": "./syntaxes/xm.tmLanguage.json" }
    ],
    "configuration": [
      {
        "title": "%configuration.compiler.title%",
        "order": 10,
        "properties": {
          "codeblocks.compilerId": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "gcc",
            "description": "默认编译器 ID（对应 options_<id>.xml）"
          },
          "codeblocks.masterPath": {
            "type": "string",
            "scope": "machine-overridable",
            "default": "",
            "description": "编译器安装根目录（留空则从 PATH 探测）"
          },
          "codeblocks.compilerPrograms": {
            "type": "object",
            "scope": "machine-overridable",
            "default": {},
            "description": "编译器程序完整路径（交叉编译器如 RISC-V 由「探测编译器」自动写入，普通编译器留空）",
            "properties": {
              "C": { "type": "string" },
              "CPP": { "type": "string" },
              "LD": { "type": "string" },
              "LIB": { "type": "string" },
              "WINDRES": { "type": "string" },
              "MAKE": { "type": "string" },
              "DBGconfig": { "type": "string" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "%configuration.build.title%",
        "order": 20,
        "properties": {
          "codeblocks.saveBeforeBuild": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "description": "构建/运行/清理前自动保存工作区中未保存的文件（对齐 Code::Blocks 的 Save all files before build）"
          },
          "codeblocks.parallelJobs": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 0,
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 64,
            "description": "并行编译任务数（0 = 自动，取 CPU 核数）"
          },
          "codeblocks.maxReportedErrors": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 50,
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "单次构建最多收集的错误数（0 = 不限制）。对齐 Code::Blocks 的 max_reported_errors，防止错误过多导致 Build Log 卡顿"
          },
          "codeblocks.build.skipIncludeDeps": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "增量编译时跳过 #include 依赖扫描（对齐 Code::Blocks 的 skip_include_deps 设置，供非 C/C++ 编译器使用）"
          },
          "codeblocks.build.verboseOutput": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "详细构建输出：完整编译命令行（对齐 Code::Blocks 详细模式）、clean/rebuild 逐文件列表、增量跳过文件列表"
          },
          "codeblocks.build.compileCommandsOnlyTargets": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "CommandsOnly 目标（type=4）是否编译其文件（对齐 Code::Blocks：CB 以空选项/空 include 编译 CommandsOnly 目标的文件；默认关闭保持扩展原行为：仅执行 pre/post 脚本）"
          },
          "codeblocks.build.plainCbLog": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "纯 Code::Blocks 日志模式：关闭脚本编号/单行完成式/Emoji 汇总块/最慢 Top3，构建结束输出 CB 风格 === Build finished === 行"
          },
          "codeblocks.build.strictQuoting": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "严格引号规则（对齐 Code::Blocks NeedQuotes：仅空格加引号）；默认关闭为宽规则（空格 + cmd 元字符，防 shell 二次解析）"
          },
          "codeblocks.log.english": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "构建日志输出英文文案（汇总/状态类消息对齐 Code::Blocks 原文）"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "%configuration.debug.title%",
        "order": 30,
        "properties": {
          "codeblocks.gdbTimeoutMs": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 30000,
            "minimum": 1000,
            "description": "GDB MI 命令超时（毫秒）。个别慢操作（加载符号、大数组子节点展开等）可适当调大"
          },
          "codeblocks.debug.initCommands": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "type": "string" },
            "default": [],
            "description": "调试会话启动后注入的 GDB 命令（按 CLI 逐条执行，如 set pagination off）；对齐 Code::Blocks Debugger settings 的初始化命令"
          },
          "codeblocks.debug.printPretty": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "调试变量显示美化（GDB set print pretty on，结构体多行缩进）"
          },
          "codeblocks.debug.printElements": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 0,
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "数组/字符串最多显示的元素数（GDB set print elements；0 = 不设置，使用 GDB 默认）"
          },
          "codeblocks.debug.disassemblyFlavor": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["default", "intel", "att"],
            "default": "default",
            "description": "反汇编语法风格（GDB set disassembly-flavor）；default = 不设置（跟随 GDB 默认）"
          },
          "codeblocks.debug.charset": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "description": "调试字符集（GDB set charset，如 UTF-8 / GBK；留空 = 不设置）"
          },
          "codeblocks.debug.gdbPath": {
            "type": "string",
            "scope": "machine-overridable",
            "default": "",
            "description": "GDB 可执行文件路径（留空自动探测：masterPath/bin → PATH）。跨工具链（如 RV32）建议显式指定对应 gdb，避免架构不匹配"
          },
          "codeblocks.debug.trace": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "调试协议跟踪：把 DAP 请求/响应/事件写入 Code::Blocks 输出通道（排查「会话异常结束/断点不生效」等问题时开启）"
          },
          "codeblocks.debug.registers": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "Registers 视图读取寄存器值（默认关闭：部分 MinGW GDB 8.1 构建在读取寄存器时会让 GDB 进程崩溃、调试会话中断；确认你的 GDB 无此问题后再开启）"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "%configuration.intellisense.title%",
        "order": 40,
        "properties": {
          "codeblocks.clangd.enabled": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "description": "是否启用 clangd 集成（自动生成 compile_commands.json 并更新 clangd 用户配置）。需安装 clangd 扩展后补全/跳转才生效"
          },
          "codeblocks.clangd.buildLogDiagnostics": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["build", "clangd"],
            "default": "build",
            "description": "检测到 clangd 时 Build Log 视图的诊断来源：build = 构建引擎完整诊断（默认，覆盖所有编译文件）；clangd = 使用 clangd 诊断（仅打开过的文件，可能不完整）。无论哪种，Problems 面板都由 clangd 产出"
          },
          "codeblocks.clangd.restartOnActiveProjectSwitch": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "description": "切换活动工程且编译数据库实际变化（存在共享文件）时，是否重启 clangd 以让已打开文件立即按新活动工程的编译命令重新分析（更新红波浪线/补全/跳转）。重启会触发 clangd 重新索引，若觉得频繁可关闭"
          },
          "codeblocks.clangd.forcedIncludes": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "type": "string" },
            "default": ["global.h"],
            "description": "clangd 分析头文件时强制预包含的基础头文件名（按 include 搜索目录查找，存在则加 -include）。默认 global.h（typedef/macro/sfr/clib 基础上下文），不要用 include.h 这类「包含所有头文件」的主头文件，否则会对被它包含的头文件造成递归包含、产生大量误报"
          },
          "codeblocks.clangd.suppressedWarnings": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "type": "string" },
            "default": ["-Wunused-function"],
            "description": "在 clangd 诊断中压制的警告类别（写入 Diagnostics.Suppress）。嵌入式 SDK 常用静态函数做编译期断言，-Wunused-function 是预期噪声"
          },
          "codeblocks.clangd.suppressHeaderDiagnostics": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "description": "是否在头文件中压制全部诊断（单独打开 .h 文件时不再显示 unknown type name 等误报）。SDK 头文件普遍不自包含，单独分析必然报错；.c 文件的真实诊断不受影响"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "%configuration.ui.title%",
        "order": 50,
        "properties": {
          "codeblocks.projectTree.categorize": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "description": "工程树按文件类型分组显示（Sources / Headers / ASM Sources / Resources / Others，对齐 Code::Blocks）。关闭后按物理目录显示。"
          },
          "codeblocks.ui.quietSuccess": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "构建成功静默模式：不弹成功 toast，仅输出日志与状态栏诊断徽标"
          },
          "codeblocks.ui.projectToolbar": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "newProject",
                "openProject",
                "build",
                "rebuild",
                "clean",
                "run",
                "debug",
                "buildWorkspace",
                "rebuildWorkspace",
                "cleanWorkspace",
                "compilerOptions",
                "projectProperties",
                "codeStats"
              ]
            },
            "default": [
              "buildWorkspace",
              "rebuildWorkspace",
              "cleanWorkspace"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "Project 视图标题栏常驻按钮（当选中的按钮在标题栏显示时，不再出现在 ⋯ 溢出菜单）。可选值：`newProject` / `openProject` / `build` / `rebuild` / `clean` / `run` / `debug` / `buildWorkspace` / `rebuildWorkspace` / `cleanWorkspace` / `compilerOptions` / `projectProperties` / `codeStats`"
          },
          "codeblocks.ui.symbolsView": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "description": "显示 Symbols 视图（初始默认隐藏，可从视图容器的 ⋯ → Views 菜单调出；关闭此设置后强制隐藏）"
          },
          "codeblocks.ui.recentProjectsLimit": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 8,
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 50,
            "description": "「最近工程」列表上限（状态栏菜单 Recent Projects；0 = 不记录）"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "%configuration.editor.title%",
        "order": 60,
        "properties": {
          "codeblocks.editor.autoHeaderGuard": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "新建空头文件（.h/.hpp/.hxx）时自动插入头文件保护宏（对齐 headerguard 插件；已有 #pragma once / #ifndef 保护的文件不处理）"
          },
          "codeblocks.editor.headerGuardStyle": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["ifndef", "pragma-once"],
            "default": "ifndef",
            "markdownDescription": "插入头文件保护的方式：`ifndef` = `#ifndef` / `#define` / `#endif` 包裹（默认）；`pragma-once` = 仅顶部 `#pragma once`"
          },
          "codeblocks.editor.tidyCommentWidth": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 80,
            "minimum": 20,
            "maximum": 200,
            "description": "Tidy 注释（块注释整理）的换行宽度（列）"
          },
          "codeblocks.astyleOptions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [
              "--style=allman",
              "--indent=spaces=4"
            ],
            "description": "AStyle 格式化选项"
          },
          "codeblocks.tools": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["name", "command"],
              "properties": {
                "name": { "type": "string", "description": "工具名称（Tools 菜单与状态栏菜单中的显示名）" },
                "command": { "type": "string", "description": "可执行文件路径或命令（支持别名宏与 Code::Blocks 宏）" },
                "arguments": { "type": "string", "description": "参数字符串（引号感知分词；支持别名宏与 CB 宏）" },
                "workingDirectory": { "type": "string", "description": "工作目录（缺省 = 活动工程目录；支持宏）" },
                "env": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": { "type": "string" }, "description": "附加环境变量" },
                "output": { "type": "string", "enum": ["output", "terminal", "silent"], "default": "output", "description": "输出模式：output = 专用输出通道；terminal = 集成终端；silent = 无输出" }
              }
            },
            "default": [],
            "markdownDescription": "用户自定义工具（对齐 Code::Blocks Tools → Configure tools…）：在「Tools」菜单与状态栏菜单末尾列出，选中即运行。支持别名宏 `${file}` / `${fileDir}` / `${projectDir}` / `${projectName}` / `${workspaceFolder}` 与 Code::Blocks 宏 `$(VAR)`（如 `$(TARGET_OUTPUT_FILE)`、项目自定义变量 `$(var)`）。示例：`{ \"name\": \"反汇编\", \"command\": \"objdump\", \"arguments\": \"-d \\\"${file}\\\"\", \"output\": \"output\" }`"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "%configuration.keybindings.title%",
        "order": 70,
        "properties": {
          "codeblocks.keybindings.cbStyle": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "markdownDescription": "启用 Code::Blocks 保真键位（默认关闭，全部避开 VS Code 默认）：`F5` 切换断点 / `Shift+F8` 停止调试 / `F2` 打开 Build Log / `Ctrl+R` 替换 / `Ctrl+Shift+B` 跳转匹配括号 / `Ctrl+Shift+C` 注释 / `Ctrl+Shift+S` 全部保存 / `Ctrl+Q` 退出 / `F12` 折叠 / `F7`·`Shift+F7`·`Ctrl+F7` 单步。开启后这些键将覆盖 VS Code 默认；关闭即恢复。可打开 [可视化快捷键设置面板](command:codeblocks.keybindings.panel) 逐项微调或单独解绑，用 [检查键位冲突](command:codeblocks.keybindings.check) 查看冲突清单。"
          },
          "codeblocks.keybindings.overrides": {
            "type": "object",
            "default": {},
            "markdownDescription": "逐命令自定义快捷键（键名 = 命令短 id，值 = 键位串，空字符串 = 解绑）。修改后自动写入用户 `keybindings.json`（仅增删托管条目 + 移除默认键的 `-command` 规则；首次写入前备份为 `keybindings.json.codeblocks-backup`）。推荐直接点开 [可视化快捷键设置面板](command:codeblocks.keybindings.panel)：按键录入 / 手动输入 / 解绑 / 恢复默认 / 导出·导入方案 / 全部重置。常用键名：`build` / `rebuild` / `clean` / `run` / `buildAndRun` / `compileCurrentFile` / `debug` / `nextError` / `prevError` / `activatePriorProject` / `activateNextProject` / `moveProjectUp` / `moveProjectDown` / `projectTreeFocus` / `buildLogFocus`；CB 保真组 `cb*`（`cbToggleBreakpoint` / `cbBuildLog` / `cbReplace` / `cbStepOver` 等 12 项）；外部别名 `aliasGotoFile` / `aliasReplaceInFiles` / `aliasSelectNextMatch`。示例：`{ \"build\": \"ctrl+alt+b\", \"cbQuit\": \"\" }`"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
